[agent:result] 
[agent:result]       Also see the section [Parameter markers] of the SQL language reference.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]       [Parameter markers]: https://docs.databricks.com/sql/language-manual/sql-ref-parameter-marker.html
[agent:result]       [`cast` function]: https://docs.databricks.com/sql/language-manual/functions/cast.html
